*** Keywords ***
TC 7782 TDD
    [Documentation]                 Generic test for CB007782_A_xxx (UL or UL_DL) tests
    [Arguments]                     ${param}
    Init Sequence                   ${param}
    Critical Step                   Set Context TDD
    Critical Step                   Restart
    Step                            Captures Init
    Critical Step                   Test WTS Setup
    Critical Step                   Test Verify Cell Setup
    Step                            Captures Start
    Step                            SgNB Addition PRACH
    Step                            Captures Stop                                                   depends=Captures Start
    Critical Step                   Check PuschMappingTypeA in RRC Msg                              depends=SgNB Addition PRACH
    Critical Step                   Check dmrs TypeA Position in RRC Msg                            depends=SgNB Addition PRACH
    Critical Step                   Check Additional DMRS UL in RRC Msg                             depends=SgNB Addition PRACH
    Step                            Attach_FR1                                                      depends=SgNB Addition PRACH
    Run Keyword if                  ${enable_sherpa}==${True}                                       Activate Sherpa
    Step                            ${param.dir} Traffic
    Run Keyword if                  ${enable_sherpa}==${True}                              Deactivate Sherpa and Stop Collect
    Run Keyword if                  ${enable_sherpa}==${True}
    ...                             Step                                                   Rename Of Sherpa Logs
    Critical Step                   Check PuschMappingTypeA UL in BIP Traces
    Critical Step                   Check dmrs TypeA Position in BIP Traces
    Critical Step                   Check Additional DMRS UL in BIP Traces
    Critical Step                   Check FDM UL in BIP Traces
    Critical Step                   Check PTRS UL in BIP Traces
    Critical Step                   Check CRC OK for HarqU in UL BIP Traces
    Critical Step                   Check NO DTX for HarqU in UL BIP Traces
    [Teardown]                      Display diagnosis
